  "question": {
    "text": "Throwing a biased die, a person will get <math><mn>5</mn></math> Rupees if he throws the number&nbsp;<math><mn>5</mn></math> and will get <math><mn>8</mn></math> Rupees for any other number, then the expected income (in Rupees) per throw is (it is given that the number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> will appear <math><mn>5</mn></math> times as frequently as any other number)"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>6.5</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>7</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>5.5</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the probability of getting any number other than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the probability of getting <math><mn>5</mn></math> is <math><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math>.<br /><math><mo>∵</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Expected income per throw&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>65</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6.5</mn></math>"
  }
